{"who":"Adam","text":"[link: news story on the abortion debate]","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T17:45","checkin":"2026-12-03T17:45"}
{"who":"Adam","text":"You see this","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T17:46","checkin":"2026-12-03T17:46"}
{"who":"Claire","text":"yeah saw it this morning","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T17:58","checkin":"2026-12-03T17:58"}
{"who":"Claire","text":"what did you think","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T17:59","checkin":"2026-12-03T17:59"}
{"who":"Adam","text":"I think it's grim the way they make it a sport","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T18:10","checkin":"2026-12-03T18:10"}
{"who":"Adam","text":"And that \"late term\" stuff means nothing to most people","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T18:11","checkin":"2026-12-03T18:11"}
{"who":"Claire","text":"it's the whole debate","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T18:22","checkin":"2026-12-03T18:22"}
{"who":"Claire","text":"the doctors in that piece are saying what they actually see","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T18:23","checkin":"2026-12-03T18:23"}
{"who":"Adam","text":"Doctors can be right and the argument is still whether a 30 week foetus is a person","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T18:31","checkin":"2026-12-03T18:31"}
{"who":"Claire","text":"not for the woman in the piece it isn't","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T18:33","checkin":"2026-12-03T18:33"}
{"who":"Adam","text":"I'm not talking about her. I'm talking about the people who vote on it","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T18:40","checkin":"2026-12-03T18:40"}
{"who":"Claire","text":"the people voting are deciding what happens to women's bodies. that's the point","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T18:44","checkin":"2026-12-03T18:44"}
{"who":"Adam","text":"A lot of people think the baby has a right to live. That's not nothing","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T18:52","checkin":"2026-12-03T18:52"}
{"who":"Claire","text":"and some women with a dying pregnancy or who've been raped shouldn't have a man in parliament deciding for them because he's squeamish","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T18:58","checkin":"2026-12-03T18:58"}
{"who":"Adam","text":"I didn't say that. Don't put words in my mouth","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T19:05","checkin":"2026-12-03T19:05"}
{"who":"Adam","text":"I just don't get how you can be so sure about something that ends a life","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T19:06","checkin":"2026-12-03T19:06"}
{"who":"Claire","text":"and I don't get how you can sit in your flat with your spreadsheets and decide what other people do with their bodies","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T19:20","checkin":"2026-12-03T19:20"}
{"who":"Claire","text":"you've never had to make that call","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T19:21","checkin":"2026-12-03T19:21"}
{"who":"Adam","text":"So people who think like me are cowards now","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T19:35","checkin":"2026-12-03T19:35"}
{"who":"Adam","text":"You're not even arguing the point anymore","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T19:36","checkin":"2026-12-03T19:36"}
{"who":"Claire","text":"you literally said I'm ending lives like I'm a murderer","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T19:40","checkin":"2026-12-03T19:40"}
{"who":"Claire","text":"that's what this whole thing is for you","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T19:41","checkin":"2026-12-03T19:41"}
{"who":"Adam","text":"Can you pick up","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T20:03","checkin":"2026-12-03T20:03"}
{"who":"Adam","text":"I'm asking properly. How can you say that about people. People who think it's wrong aren't monsters","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T20:14","checkin":"2026-12-03T20:14"}
{"who":"Claire","text":"I never said that. I said you think women should carry it","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T20:15","checkin":"2026-12-03T20:15"}
{"who":"Claire","text":"which is basically what you think","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T20:15","checkin":"2026-12-03T20:15"}
{"who":"Adam","text":"It's not my body though is it","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T20:31","checkin":"2026-12-03T20:31"}
{"who":"Claire","text":"no. that's kind of my point","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T20:33","checkin":"2026-12-03T20:33"}
{"who":"Claire","text":"not doing this on here. mum's lunch still the 13th? someone has to ring the place","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T21:52","checkin":"2026-12-03T21:52"}
{"who":"Adam","text":"I'll ring them Tues","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T22:40","checkin":"2026-12-03T22:40"}
{"who":"Adam","text":"Sorry I got a bit worked up","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-03T23:12","checkin":"2026-12-03T23:12"}
{"who":"Adam","text":"You still up","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-04T00:40","checkin":"2026-12-04T00:40"}
{"who":"Claire","text":"sorry was asleep. you ok?","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-04T07:58","checkin":"2026-12-04T07:58"}
{"who":"Adam","text":"Yeah. Bad night's sleep, that's all","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-04T08:10","checkin":"2026-12-04T08:10"}
{"who":"Adam","text":"Landlord's putting the rent up 8% from Feb. Good morning","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-04T08:11","checkin":"2026-12-04T08:11"}
{"who":"Claire","text":"ugh. can you push back","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-04T08:14","checkin":"2026-12-04T08:14"}
{"who":"Adam","text":"Already did. Didn't work","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-04T08:15","checkin":"2026-12-04T08:15"}
{"who":"Claire","text":"re last night. I shouldn't have said you've never had to make that call. that was a cheap shot","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-04T08:30","checkin":"2026-12-04T08:30"}
{"who":"Claire","text":"you're not a coward and I know you're not a bad person. I just think you're wrong","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-04T08:31","checkin":"2026-12-04T08:31"}
{"who":"Adam","text":"Cheers. I went too far with the cowards thing too","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-04T09:02","checkin":"2026-12-04T09:02"}
{"who":"Adam","text":"I still think the baby's life counts for something though. Not saying you have to agree","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-04T09:04","checkin":"2026-12-04T09:04"}
{"who":"Adam","text":"Doesn't have to be settled over text","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-04T09:05","checkin":"2026-12-04T09:05"}
{"who":"Claire","text":"agreed. not over text","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-04T09:30","checkin":"2026-12-04T09:30"}
